    narr:generatedFrom "6cf79c8e3982b68579c6ffa684bc42ec05ff6980" ;
    narr:narration """On 2026-08-11, DaveQuantum declared a decision to migrate the analytics pipeline off PostgreSQL onto QuantumDB, framing it as a settled move rather than a proposal — [a switch stated as fact](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_1). The justification rests on two quantified claims: [10x query performance and lower licensing cost](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_2), both voiced as present-tense fact rather than projected benefit. XenaExpertgh's editorial restatement consolidates the decision into three bullets — the [migration shorthand](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_3), the [performance gain figure](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_4), and a [Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_5) — attaching a concrete future commitment to what DaveQuantum framed as already decided. The performance claim (10x) appears in both voices, but the cost claim (lower licensing) surfaces only in DaveQuantum's original justification and does not carry into the editorial summary, leaving the cost rationale thinner than the performance one. No scope detail beyond 'analytics pipeline' is given, and no risk or counter-consideration is voiced anywhere in the graph.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_3> ;
